# A completed rewrite whose cutover never moves the alias: readers are promised
# the rewritten values while the view keeps the old copy.
MODULE: IntendedContributionCutoverNotPublished
TARGET: IntendedContribution
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: cutover reports done without moving the alias
PERTURBS: Cutover

--- FIND
    /\ phys' = 2 /\ rw' = "done"
--- REPLACE
    /\ rw' = "done" /\ UNCHANGED phys
--- END
